  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Empowerment Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to increase under representation of people with disabilities in the Senegal labour market, enabling them to participate, contribute and benefit from their local market.  


The two-year project funded by Sightsavers is intended as a pilot to generate evidence an experience on the implementation of the economic empowerment model in the Senegal context, which can be used to leverage further restricted investment to continue the project.</narrative>
  </description>
